            <ArticleTitle>The prognostic value of exercise testing.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>229-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article discusses the prognostic value contained in exercise testing in patients with cardiac diseases. Exercise testing is a valuable mean of risk stratification and assessment of therapeutic intervention of cardiac patients that complements history and physical examination in the management of these patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
